      "prompt": "Given the following reactions: (1) N₂(g) + 2O₂(g) → 2NO₂(g), ΔH = +66.4 kJ; (2) 2NO(g) + O₂(g) → 2NO₂(g), ΔH = −114.2 kJ.",
