      "prompt": "Given the following two reactions at the same temperature: (1) N₂(g) + O₂(g) ⇌ 2NO(g), K₁ = 4.1 × 10⁻³¹; (2) N₂(g) + 2O₂(g) ⇌ 2NO₂(g), K₂ = 4.1 × 10⁻⁹.",
