            "K<sub>a</sub> = x²/(0.120 − x) ≈ x²/0.120 = 6.3 × 10⁻⁵, so x² = 7.56 × 10⁻⁶ and x = [H⁺] = 2.75 × 10⁻³ M.",
            "Check: (2.75 × 10⁻³/0.120) × 100 = 2.3%, under 5%, so the approximation is valid.",
